/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:345: When the asset price grows, options are not exercised, and the trader loses only the difference in premiums.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:361: Initially, the profit/loss is equal to the difference between the premiums paid.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:363: If the price rises above the strike of the bought option, the loss is limited to the premium difference, since non of the two options will be exercised (parties will not sell the asset at a price below the market).
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:365: The largest loss is found in the range between the strikes of the long and short options. In this case, the purchased options are in-the-money, in contrast to sold ones. The loss is calculated as follows: Long option strike - Short option strike +/- Premium difference.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:367: If the asset price then falls, the portfolio reaches the breakeven level. When the price falls, the profit is not limited: Put option strike - Underlying asset price +/- Premium difference.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:441: Profit: Put option strike - Underlying asset price +/- Premium difference
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-029/text/www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/trading/options_board.txt:442: Loss: Underlying asset price - Call option strike +/- Premium difference
